msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Play Main Story"
msgstr "Historia Principal"

msgid "Play Bonus Story"
msgstr "Historia Extra"

msgid "RYUUJI's turn!"
msgstr "¡Turno de RYUUJI!"

msgid "TAIGA used a death ray!＿BIBIBIBIBIBI......＿but it doesn't affect MINORIN!"
msgstr "¡TAIGA usó un rayo mortal!＿BIBIBIBIBIBI......＿¡pero no afecta a MINORIN!"

msgid "MINORIN's turn!"
msgstr "¡Turno de MINORIN!"

msgid "YURI's red string was cut!＿It was a critical hit!＿She's going crazy!"
msgstr "¡Se cortó el hilo rojo de YURI!＿¡Fue un golpe crítico!＿¡Se está volviendo loca!"

msgid "YURI's turn!"
msgstr "¡Turno de YURI!"

msgid "YURI bought a condo! But it wasn't＿earthquake resistant!"
msgstr "¡YURI compró un departamento! ¡Pero no＿era antisísmico!"

msgid "Ryuuji「(Aaaaaaaaagh!!!!)」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「(¡Aaaaaaaaagh!!!!)」"

msgid "The apartment collapsed!"
msgstr "¡El departamento se derrumbó!"

msgid "RYUUJI can't move!"
msgstr "¡RYUUJI no puede moverse!"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Damn it! I can't get out of this debris!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Maldición! ¡No puedo salir＿de estos escombros!）」"

msgid "RYUUJI can't move!＿RYUUJI can't move!＿RYUUJI can't.............................."
msgstr "¡RYUUJI no puede moverse!＿¡RYUUJI no puede moverse!＿RYUUJI no puede.............................."

msgid "???「......Ugh!!」"
msgstr "???「......¡Ugh!!」"

msgid "???「..................Oh?」"
msgstr "???「..................¿Eh?」"

msgid "???「Where...... Where am I......?」"
msgstr "???「¿Dónde...... Dónde estoy......?」"

msgid "???「......! Whoa!!」"
msgstr "???「...... ¡Uah!!」"

msgid "???「D-Don't kill m......eh?」"
msgstr "???「N-No me mat...... ¿eh?」"

msgid "???「......Oh...... j-just a mirror, nothing to be＿scared...... Ohh!?」"
msgstr "???「......Ah...... s-solo es un espejo,＿nada de qué asustarse...... ¡¿Ehh?!」"

msgid "???「W-Wait a sec...... I......! I, I'm......」"
msgstr "???「E-Espera un segundo......＿¡Yo......! Yo, yo soy......」"

msgid "???「......Who am I?」"
msgstr "???「......¿Quién soy?」"

msgid "???「......*Gasp*! Ryuuji, Ryuujiii!」"
msgstr "???「......¡Ah! ¡Ryuuji, Ryuujiii!」"

msgid "???「......Oh?」"
msgstr "???「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "???「Ryuuji, Ryuuji, Ryuuujiiii!」"
msgstr "???「¡Ryuuji, Ryuuji, Ryuuujiiii!」"

msgid "Ryuuji?「O-O-Ohh......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji?「¿E-E-Ehh......?」"

msgid "???「Thank goodness, you're finally＿awake...... What a relief. I'm so glad......」"
msgstr "???「Menos mal, por fin despertaste......＿Qué alivio. Me alegro tanto......」"

msgid "Ryuuji?「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji?「......」"

msgid "???「Are you okay? Are you hurt＿anywhere?」"
msgstr "???「¿Estás bien? ¿Te duele＿alguna parte?」"

msgid "Ryuuji?「Oh...... Err......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji?「Ah...... Ehm......」"

msgid "???「Why are you all spaced out......? Well, I＿can't say I blame you. You've been in a＿coma for the past three days.」"
msgstr "???「¿Por qué estás tan aturdido......?＿Bueno, no puedo culparte. Has estado＿en coma los últimos tres días.」"

msgid "Ryuuji?「......Three days?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji?「......¿Tres días?」"

msgid "Ryuuji?「The 28th......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji?「El 28......」"

msgid "???「Yacchan and I have been taking turns＿to look after you...... Oh, she's probably＿resting at home right now.」"
msgstr "???「Yacchan y yo nos hemos turnado para＿cuidarte...... Ah, ella probablemente＿esté descansando en casa ahora mismo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji?「H-Hold on a minute.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji?「E-Espera un momento.」"

msgid "???「What is it?」"
msgstr "???「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji?「Er...... \"Ryuuji\"? Is that my name?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji?「Ehm...... ¿\"Ryuuji\"? ¿Ese es mi nombre?」"

msgid "???「Huh? Don't be stupid. That's your＿name right there.」"
msgstr "???「¿Eh? No digas tonterías. Es tu＿nombre el que está ahí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I didn't notice...... Takasu, Ryuuji......＿Takasu Ryuuji......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, no me había dado cuenta......＿Takasu, Ryuuji...... Takasu Ryuuji......」"

msgid "???「......Hey, Ryuuji, what's the deal? This＿some kind of joke?」"
msgstr "???「......Oye, Ryuuji, ¿qué te pasa? ¿Esto＿es algún tipo de broma?」"

msgid "???「Oh my, what a pickle. Your tiny brain＿overheated, and now you've finally＿gone over the deep end.」"
msgstr "???「Vaya lío. Tu diminuto cerebro＿se sobrecalentó, y ahora por fin＿perdiste la cabeza.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, seems like it. I can't remember＿who YOU are, either.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, parece que sí. Tampoco recuerdo＿quién eres TÚ.」"

msgid "???「Hmph. Well, don't call me \"you\".」"
msgstr "???「Jum. Bueno, no me llames \"tú\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry...... What should I call you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Perdón...... ¿Cómo debería llamarte?」"

msgid "???「Call me \"Taiga\" like usual, I guess.」"
msgstr "???「Llámame \"Taiga\" como siempre, supongo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Tiger\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Tigre\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, no, I'm quite serious! ......So, you＿write \"Taiga\" with the kanji for 'big' and＿'river'?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No, no, lo digo muy en serio!＿......Entonces, ¿\"Taiga\" se escribe＿con los kanji de 'grande' y 'río'?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Well yeah, but...... you're really, really＿not kidding? You can't remember＿anything?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Bueno, sí, pero......＿¿de verdad, de verdad no estás＿bromeando? ¿No puedes recordar nada?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... Nope, zilch, nada.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... No, nada de nada.」"

msgid "Taiga「......I, I'm going to call the doctor.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......V-Voy a llamar al doctor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien......」"

msgid "Taiga「......Hey, Ryuuji......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Oye, Ryuuji......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Sí?」"

msgid "Taiga「Do you remember what happened the＿night of Christmas Eve?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Recuerdas lo que pasó en＿Nochebuena?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................I'm sorry, no.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................Lo siento, no.」"

msgid "Taiga「......I see.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ya veo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There's something in this world that＿no one has ever seen.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hay algo en este mundo que＿nadie ha visto jamás.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It is soft and very sweet. Were they＿able to see it, everyone would want to＿have it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es suave y muy dulce. Si pudieran＿verlo, todos desearían tenerlo.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's why no one has ever seen it.＿The world hid it so as to make it＿difficult to obtain.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Por eso nadie lo ha visto jamás.＿El mundo lo ocultó para que fuera＿difícil de obtener.」"

msgid "Minori「But there will come a day when it is＿discovered.」"
msgstr "Minori「Pero llegará el día en que sea＿descubierto.」"

msgid "Ami「And only one who deserves it will be＿able to find it.」"
msgstr "Ami「Y solo quien lo merezca será＿capaz de encontrarlo.」"

msgid "Everyone「And that's how the story goes.」"
msgstr "Todos「Y así es la historia.」"

msgid "???「Yeah. On Christmas morning, Yacchan＿found you collapsed in the kitchen.」"
msgstr "???「Sí. La mañana de Navidad, Yacchan＿te encontró desplomado en la cocina.」"

msgid "???「She rushed you to the hospital and＿you were admitted straight away. And＿now it's the 28th.」"
msgstr "???「Te llevó de urgencia al hospital y＿te internaron de inmediato. Y＿ahora es 28.」"

msgid "???「She said she had to go to work no＿matter what. It's the end of the year, so＿it's busy. She was worried to death」"
msgstr "???「Dijo que tenía que ir a trabajar como＿fuera. Es fin de año, así que hay mucho＿trabajo. Estaba muerta de preocupación」"

msgid "???「about you.」"
msgstr "???「por ti.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, actually...... ever since I woke up, I＿haven't been able to remember＿anything. Even my own name feels」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, la verdad...... desde que desperté,＿no he podido recordar nada.＿Hasta mi propio nombre me resulta」"

msgid "Ryuuji「foreign to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「ajeno.」"

msgid "Tiger?「......Ryuuji, you're doing this on purpose,＿aren't you?」"
msgstr "Tigre?「......Ryuuji, estás haciendo esto＿a propósito, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Tiger?「As soon as you get discharged,＿prepare to be beaten to a pulp!」"
msgstr "Tigre?「En cuanto te den el alta,＿¡prepárate, que te voy a moler a golpes!」"
